# NMiAI 2026 Grocery Bot
# Get your token: https://app.ainm.no → Challenge → Play → copy the WebSocket URL.
# Set EITHER the full URL or the token (we build the URL from token if needed).

# Full WebSocket URL (paste from the "Play" page):
# GROCERY_BOT_WS_URL=wss://game.ainm.no/ws?token=eyJ...

# Or only the JWT token (we use wss://game.ainm.no/ws?token=<this>):
# GROCERY_BOT_TOKEN=eyJ...
